  "generatedAt": "2026-10-06T12:52:41.168Z",
  "title": "Devcontainer becomes a full agent factory image",
  "summary": "This change turns the devcontainer from a minimal Rust image into a pinned, checksum-verified factory image: it installs moon, gh, actionlint, uv, Node/pnpm/Bun, four coding agents (codex, claude-code, opencode, omp), dsh from its own lockfile, and the NVIDIA skill linters; it builds the dsh/omp/opencode writing-check integrations from the workspace lockfile; it replaces the system-wide core.hooksPath with a git wrapper that forces the hooks path only under the workspace; and it wires every agent's hook files to `osf hook` root-owned and read-only, with build-time tests proving each of those claims.",
  "lenses": [
    "architecture",
    "data-flow"
  ],
